        <source>::He raises his right eyebrow.:: A shotgun, you say...

I have one unaccounted-for shotgun here. ::He shows you a rust-bitten, taped up shotgun.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a55" name="=&gt;a55">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">110</mda:meta>
