        <source>I can't believe Gorsky's dead. Damn, $(context.player.Name), I saw him in my dream last night. Shooting at the range, all in the center, no deviation. And then he looked over at the armory... and he smiled at me. 

What kind of a derailed dream is that in which Gorsky smiles. Rest in peace, big guy.&lt;end&gt;</source>
